"description":"It’s easy to make the most of your United Healthcare benefits and access care on-the-go with the UnitedHealthcare app†. Just sign in or create an account for secure, convenient access to your health plan.  \n \nCheck your benefits: \n - See what your plan covers, including copays and out-of-pocket expenses.  \n - Track your deductible and out-of-pocket max. \n - Follow new claims from start to finish and review old claims too.  \n - Check your health reimbursement, flexible spending, and Optum Bank HSA balances. \n - † Pay your claims using Optum Bank HSA balances \n \nFind & price care:  \n - Search doctors, specialists, hospitals, and clinics in-network and near you \n - † Access virtual primary care and start a virtual urgent care visit, 24/7 \n - Create favorites for your PCP provider information and commonly visited hospitals and clinics so you can find them quickly next time. \n - † Find out how much a service or treatment might cost you before you get care.  \n \nAccess the info you need: \n - See your records, including immunizations, lab results and procedures from all your providers. \n - Use your digital member ID card from the app whenever and wherever you get care. \n - † Save your health plan details to your Digital Wallet for easy access \n - † Access your UnitedHealthcare UCard™ to make in-store or online purchases using benefit credit, spend earned rewards and more \n \nPrescriptions: \n - † Fill prescriptions, review medications, and search medication info and pricing   \n \nTake charge of your health:  \n - † Earn rewards by logging your activities, including tracking your steps with Apple HealthKit® integration \n \nGet help with live chat: \n - † Ask your questions and get the answers you need from a live UnitedHealthcare advocate \n \n - † Not all United Healthcare plans are currently supported by the app. Features and benefits will vary depending on your plan type.", "averageUserRating":4.6942599999999998772182152606546878814697265625, "trackCensoredName":"UnitedHealthcare", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/unitedhealthcare/id1348316600?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"12+", "userRatingCount":875381}]
